# Edu-Motherwell Development Organisation Website

A modern, responsive, and accessible static website designed for the Edu-Motherwell Development Organisation in Motherwell, Gqeberha. This platform showcases community programs, provides organisational background, and enables community members, partners, and volunteers to get in touch.

---

## 📌 Project Overview

* **Organisation Name:** Edu-Motherwell Development Organisation
* **Location:** Motherwell, Gqeberha, South Africa
* **Primary Objective:** Empower vulnerable communities, uplift local youth, and combat low educational outcomes through literacy, numeracy, and resource support.
* **Tech Stack:** HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript (vanilla)

---

## 📁 File & Directory Structure

```text
edu-motherwell-website/
│
├── index.html              # Main landing page (Hero & Feature Cards)
├── _shared.css             # Shared global layout & navigation styles
│
├── css/
│   └── style.css           # Page-specific component styles (Cards, Forms, Grid)
│
├── images/
│   ├── Company.logo.jpg    # Organisation logo
│   ├── school-org.jpg      # Community & school initiative showcase
│   └── 1600px_COLOURBOX.jpg# Literacy & foundational learning image
│
├── pages/
│   ├── about.html          # Organisational History, Mission, and Vision cards
│   ├── services.html       # Detailed overview of educational & youth services
│   ├── enquiry.html        # Interactive enquiry form with category selection
│   └── contactus.html      # Contact details, opening hours, and embedded map
│
├── README.md               # Project documentation
└── CHANGELOG.md            # Version history and development log

